  <div class="prose">
    <p>I'm James Flores, a nurse in the laser department at {{ site.clinic.name }} in Al Hamra, Riyadh. I treat men for laser hair removal every day — beard lines, neck, chest, back and full body.</p>
    <p>I started this blog because the same good questions come up in almost every consultation: how many sessions, why the gap between them, what to do before and after, and whether laser suits a particular skin type. These articles answer them properly, in English and Arabic, so you arrive at your session already knowing what to expect.</p>

